 1. By changing BATCH_STATUS = 'SCHEDULED' back to 'P', your getPendingBatchesForChecker query (WHERE p.BATCH_STATUS = 'P') will successfully find the rows.
 2. The UI data-grids on both the Status Screen and the Authorization Screen can now seamlessly fetch and unwrap the dataset without getting blank arrays or processing locks.
